  "citation": "Strret-Perrott F A; Marchand D S; Roberts N; Harrison S P (1989): Global Lake-Level Variations from 18,000 to 0 Years Ago: A Palaeoclimatic Analysis. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1464221",
